  "title": "Easy &amp; Elegant Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "Smithfield pork tenderloin is seasoned with peppercorn and garlic, then coated with Italian-style bread crumbs and roasted in the oven to perfection for an easy and elegant main dish.",
  "authors": [
